  "page_date": "2/21/2024",
  "chunk_title": "About Azure AI services encryption",
  "chunk_content": "About Azure AI services encryption  Azure OpenAI is part of Azure AI services. Azure AI services data is encrypted and decrypted using FIPS 140-2 compliant 256-bit AES encryption. Encryption and decryption are transparent, meaning encryption and access are managed for you. Your data is secure by default and you don't need to modify your code or applications to take advantage of encryption.",
